":{"zh":"北伐中原","en":"Northern Expedition"},"year":"227","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1023","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[74,78,60,61,67,75],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004702","armor":"WP1009005","helmet":"WP1020705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1023","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[74,78,60,61,67,75],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004702","armor":"WP1009005","helmet":"WP1020705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1023","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[74,78,60,61,67,75],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004702","armor":"WP1009005","helmet":"WP1020705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1023","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[74,78,60,61,67,75],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004702","armor":"WP1009005","helmet":"WP1020705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1023","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[74,78,60,61,67,75],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004702","armor":"WP1009005","helmet":"WP1020705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1023","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[74,78,60,61,67,75],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1004702","armor":"WP1009005","helmet":"WP1020705"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"兖州山阳郡钜野县人，李乾之子，李典的从兄。父亲李乾被杀后，李整接管了父亲的旧部，成为这支家族武装的继承人。李整接手部队后，首要任务是为父报仇。他与其他将领一同攻打薛兰、李封，并成功将其击败。在随后的兖州平定战中，李整屡立战功，因功绩卓著，被逐步升迁为青州刺史。建安五年，正值官渡之战爆发之际，李整不幸去世，其堂弟李典接管了他的军队。","tc":"兗州山陽郡鉅野縣人，李乾之子，李典的從兄。父親李乾被殺后，李整接管了父親的舊部，成為這支家族武裝的繼承人。李整接手部隊后，首要任務是為父報仇。他與其他將領一同攻打薛蘭、李封，并成功將其擊敗。在隨后的兗州平定戰中，李整屢立戰功，因功績卓著，被逐步升遷為青州刺史。建安五年，正值官渡之戰爆發之際，李整不幸去世，其堂弟李典接管了他的軍隊。","en":"A native of Juye County, Shanyang Commandery, Yan Province, son of Li Qian and elder cousin of Li Dian. After his father Li Qian was killed, Li Zheng took command of his father's former subordinates, becoming the successor to this Family armed force. Upon taking over the troops, Li Zheng's priority was avenging his father. He joined other generals in attacking Xue Lan and Li Feng, successfully defeating them. In the subsequent pacification of Yan Province, Li Zheng repeatedly distinguished himself in battle. Due to his outstanding Merit, he was gradually promoted to Inspector of Qing Province. In the fifth year of Jian'an, just as the Battle of Guandu erupted, Li Zheng untimely passed away, and his cousin Li Dian assumed command of his army.","jp":"兗州山陽郡鉅野県の人。李乾の子で、李典の従兄にあたる。父の李乾が殺害された後、李整は父の旧部を引き継ぎ、この家族武装の継承者となった。軍を引き継いだ李整の第一の務めは父の仇討ちであり、諸将とともに薛蘭や李封を攻め、これを撃破することに成功した。その後の兗州平定戦でも度々軍功を挙げ、顕著な功績により青州刺史へと累進した。建安五年、折しも官渡の戦いが勃発した際に李整は惜しくも世を去り、従弟の李典がその軍を引き継いだ。","kr":"연주 산양군 거야현 사람으로, 이건의 아들이자 이전의 사촌 형이다. 아버지 이건이 살해당한 뒤 부친의 옛 부하들을 통솔하며 가문 무장 세력의 후계자가 되었다. 부대를 이어받은 이정의 최우선 과제는 부친의 원수를 갚는 것이었다. 다른 장수들과 함께 설란과 이봉을 공격하여 성공적으로 격파했다. 이어진 연주 평정전에서도 여러 차례 전공을 세웠으며, 뛰어난 공적으로 점차 승진하여 청주자사에 이르렀다. 건안 5년, 마침 관도 전투가 일어났을 무렵 불행히도 세상을 떠났고, 사촌 동생인 이전이 부대를 이어받았다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1030015","remark":"普武","surname":"李","surnameTc":"李","surnameEn":"Li","surnameJp":"李","surnameKr":"이","surnameOther":"","name":"整","nameTc":"整","na